program	enum145_init_rejected.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	enum `Color` cannot declare an `init`: an enum's cases are its constructors
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: enum `Color` cannot declare an `init`: an enum's cases are its constructors"
log	"  --> examples/enum145_init_rejected.saw:15:5"
log	"     |"
log	" 15 |     init(bright: Bool) -> Color {"
log	"     |     ^"
log	"   hint: construct it by naming a case (`Color.SomeCase`), or add a static method returning `Color` if it needs to compute which case to build"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
